WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.601
Shelfmark keeps every link you save in one place.

2
00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:08.156
Open the demo: no account needed.

3
00:00:08.156 --> 00:00:12.248
Paste a link.

4
00:00:12.248 --> 00:00:18.000
The preview fills in by itself.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.991
Put it in a folder…

6
00:00:20.991 --> 00:00:24.163
…and give it a tag.

7
00:00:24.163 --> 00:00:29.869
Save it, and it lands on your shelf.

8
00:00:29.869 --> 00:00:33.953
Folders and tags keep the shelf in order.

9
00:00:33.953 --> 00:00:41.003
A tag gathers its links from every folder.

10
00:00:41.003 --> 00:00:42.540
Need it again? Press ⌘K.

11
00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:48.086
Search finds titles, notes, folders and tags.

12
00:00:48.086 --> 00:00:51.587
Shelfmark. Every link, back within reach.
